    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7BPsXz",
      "title": "Fix CircleCI config grammar and formatting issues",
      "author": "Zentex1337",
      "number": 1271,
      "body": "## Summary\n- Remove mention of 'nx' in setup command description since nx is not used in the project\n- Fix grammar in continue-if-not-bot description ('run by' -> 'is run by')\n- Capitalize 'GitHub' consistently throughout\n- Fix indentation of stale job to match other jobs (was using extra spaces)\n- Fix double space after period in close-issue-message and close-pr-message\n- Capitalize 'PR' in stale-pr-message for consistency with close-pr-message\n\n## Test plan\n- YAML syntax is valid (no structural changes)\n- Changes are cosmetic/documentation only",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-03T17:04:54Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 14,
      "deletions": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7BPqMw",
      "title": "Add missing supported chains to README documentation",
      "author": "Zentex1337",
      "number": 1268,
      "body": "## Summary\n- Added 9 supported chains that were missing from the README documentation:\n  - unichain and unichain-sepolia\n  - soneium and soneium-minato\n  - swellchain\n  - ink and ink-sepolia\n  - worldchain and worldchain-sepolia\n- Reorganized the list to group mainnet chains with their testnet counterparts for better readability\n\n## Test plan\n- Verified all added chains exist in src/types.ts and src/chains.ts",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
